A Slimefun addon that adds infinity-tier items, machines, and resource generators.

## Requirements
- Java 25
- Paper 1.16.* - 26.1.*
- [Slimefun 5](https://github.com/Slimefun5/Slimefun5)

InfinityExpansion adds a bunch of new machines and resources, expanding the endgame of Slimefun by a large margin.

